Description: HiSilicon (Kirin 9000c) GPU compatibility layer for GXDE
 Enables hardware-accelerated (Maleoon 910) GXDE desktop on HiSilicon
 Kirin 9000c machines running the Kylin 5.10.97-38-9000c kernel.
 .
 Provides:
  - startgxde_wlcom_9000c session launcher (hisi EGL/gbm/GLESv2),
    auto-invoked by gxde-wlcom (>= 2.1.6-gxde5) when the kirin 9000c
    kernel is detected
  - UOS libwayland 1.21 client/cursor libraries (the hisi driver was
    built against them; Debian's 1.23 lacks wl_proxy_ref & co.)
  - libhisi_gbm_shim.so LD_PRELOAD shim (eglGetPlatformDisplay for Qt,
    gbm_bo_create_with_modifiers2/gbm_bo_get_fd_for_plane for Xwayland,
    and a corrected wl_surface_interface fixing Qt6 "no event 2")
  - xwayland-mesa wrapper so Xwayland uses Mesa instead of the hisi GL
 .
